.TH OPENDIAL 1 "2026-11-10" "OpenDial 0.9.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
opendial \- settings for the Microsoft Surface Dial
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opendial
[\fB\-\-page\fR \fIname\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opendial
is the graphical configuration app for
.BR opendiald (1):
pair the Dial, arrange the radial menu, create tools with separate clockwise,
counter-clockwise and click actions, set up per-app profiles, tune rotation and
haptics, review approvals and plugins, and export diagnostics.
Changes apply immediately. Starting it again raises the existing window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-page " name"
Open on \fIdashboard\fR, \fImenu\fR, \fIprofiles\fR, \fIrotation\fR, \fIdevice\fR,
\fIintegrations\fR, \fIdiagnostics\fR or \fIsettings\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR opendiald (1),
.BR opendialctl (1)
